    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87303" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεξ-αγκωνίζω</span></b> , as a pugilistic term, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spar before</i> beginning to
			fight: hence metaph., of a speaker, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν προεξαγκωνίσας οὐδὲ
					προανακινήσας εὐθὺς ἄρχεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1416a2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
